  "details": "# Issue:\n\nNormally clicking on UI Buttons in the VRChat Menu plays a sound, this always happens when letting go of your trigger / mouse button.  \n\nThis is however not the case when clicking on a Username in the new Here Tab Layout, there no sound plays.\n\nClicking on their User Icon however does play sound.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**  \n\n1. Launch VRChat  \n\n2. Open the Quick Menu Here Tab\n\n3. Click on your own or another users Username\n\nIf you do this you will notice that no interaction / button audio is playing.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nClicking on a Username in the Here Tab should play an interaction sound, just like other UI elements do.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a Video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/z0oyy4.mp4",
